-- Deepest level of the three-level chain. Handles nothing itself —
-- its only job is to ask its direct parent (base_chain_leaf) for
-- Pong and re-export the answer. If `to base` ever skipped a level or
-- fell through to the root, this would answer null and the test's
-- assert would catch it.
emit Pong { value = 1 } to base get up
export let up = up.value
